=> C0 = [sigma0(W1)-W1 part] + P(a4) + Q(a4;a2,a3) + const exactly (residual 0 above);
   P is the one-input per-context map Frame C tabulated; Q moves with a2 and a3, so C0's
   a4-dependence is a THREE-input function and no one-input table inverts it; and C0 still
   contains a1 non-deferrably, so a table for a4 leaves a1 without a home.

